R COMPOSITE_TEST_EXPR "1 OR 2 OR 3 OR 4 OR 5 OR 6 OR 7 OR 8 OR 9 OR 10 OR 11 OR 12 OR 13 OR 14 OR 15" OUTPUT PASSED_0 FEATURE_TYPE TestFilter_<at>Value<openparen>fclass<closeparen><space>=<space>footway OUTPUT FAILED FEATURE_TYPE TestFilter_<lt>UNFILTERED<gt>
